      "control_description": "A bucket with Block Public Access enabled can still serve objects publicly through CloudFront if the bucket policy grants access to the cloudfront.amazonaws.com service principal. This creates a false sense of security \u2014 the bucket appears private but objects are accessible via the CloudFront distribution URL.\n",
